   "stage_hint": null,
   "brief": "The Superannuation Supervisory Levy Imposition Amendment Bill 2020 was moved for a second reading to give the Treasurer flexibility to set levies so superannuation industry institutions pay their appropriate share, complementing the APRA Industry Funding Bill 2020."
